    'Lim 2020': 'Colorectal cancer tissue; ModScore > 13',
    'Wei 2020': 'Pancreatic cells, ADMA antibody; localisation probability > 0.75',
    'Hartel 2019': 'HEK293T and LN229 cells, antibody and SCX enrichment; ADMA and SDMA distinguished by characteristic neutral losses (added in v1.2.0)',
