          (a && a.n ? '; AlphaMissense mean ' + (a.sum / a.n).toFixed(3) + ' over ' + a.n + ' R→X substitutions (' + amClass(a.sum / a.n) + '), max ' + a.max.toFixed(3) + ', ' + a.lp + ' likely pathogenic' : '') + '.</p>';
